msgid "Godot's architecture overview"
msgstr "Godot의 아키텍처 개요"

msgid ""
"The following diagram describes the most important aspects of Godot's "
"architecture. It's not designed to be exhaustive, with the purpose of just "
"giving a high-level overview of the main components and their relationships "
"to each other."
msgstr ""
"다음 다이어그램은 Godot 아키텍처의 가장 중요한 측면을 설명합니다. 단지 주요 "
"구성 요소와 이들 구성 요소 간의 관계에 대한 높은 수준의 개요를 제공하기 위한 "
"목적으로 철저하게 설계되지 않았습니다."

msgid ""
"Diagram of Godot's Architecture; divided into three layers (from top to "
"bottom: Scene layer, Server layer, and Drivers & Platform interface layer), "
"with Core and Main separated on the right side since they interact with all "
"layers."
msgstr ""
"Godot의 아키텍처 다이어그램; 3개의 레이어(상단에서 하단으로: 씬 레이어, 서버 "
"레이어, 드라이버 및 플랫폼 인터페이스 레이어)로 나누어져 있으며, 코어와 메인"
"은 모든 레이어와 상호 작용하므로 오른쪽에 구분되어 있습니다."

msgid ""
"Credit: `Hendrik Brucker <https://github.com/Geometror/godot-architecture-"
"diagram>`__"
msgstr "https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects"

msgid "Scene Layer"
msgstr "씬 레이어"

msgid ""
"The Scene layer is the highest level of Godot's architecture, providing the "
"scene system, which is the main way to build and structure your applications "
"or games. See :ref:`class_SceneTree` / :ref:`doc_scene_tree` "
"and :ref:`class_Node` for more information."
msgstr ""
"씬 레이어는 Godot 아키텍처의 최고 수준으로, 애플리케이션이나 게임을 구축하고 "
"구조화하는 주요 방법인 씬 시스템을 제공합니다. 자세한 내용"
"은 :ref:`class_SceneTree` / :ref:`doc_scene_tree` 및 :ref:`class_Node`를 참조"
"하세요."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/scene/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/scene>`__"
msgstr "https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects"

msgid "Server Layer"
msgstr "서버 레이어"

msgid ""
"Server components implement most of Godot's subsystems (rendering, audio, "
"physics, etc.). They are singleton objects initialized at engine startup."
msgstr ""
"서버 구성 요소는 대부분의 Godot 하위 시스템(렌더링, 오디오, 물리 등)을 구현합"
"니다. 엔진 시작 시 초기화되는 싱글톤 개체입니다."

msgid ""
"`Why does Godot use servers and RIDs? <https://godotengine.org/article/why-"
"does-godot-use-servers-and-rids>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Godot는 왜 서버와 RID를 사용합니까? <https://godotengine.org/article/why-"
"does-godot-use-servers-and-rids>`__"

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/servers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/servers>`__"
msgstr "https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects"

msgid "Drivers / Platform Interface"
msgstr "드라이버 / 플랫폼 인터페이스"

msgid ""
"This layer abstracts low-level platform-specific details, containing drivers "
"for graphics APIs, audio backends and operating system interfaces (all "
"platform-specific :ref:`class_OS` and :ref:`class_DisplayServer` "
"implementations)."
msgstr ""
"This layer abstracts low-level platform-specific details, containing drivers "
"for graphics APIs, audio backends and operating system interfaces (all "
"platform-specific :ref:`class_OS` and :ref:`class_DisplayServer` "
"implementations)."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/drivers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/drivers>`__ and `/platform/* <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/tree/master/platform>`__"
msgstr ""
"공식 GDExtension 바인딩: `C <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-headers>` "
"및 `C++ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`."

msgid "Core"
msgstr "코어"

msgid ""
"The Engine's core contains essential functionality and data structures used "
"throughout the engine, like :ref:`class_Object` "
"and :ref:`class_ClassDB`, :ref:`memory management "
"<doc_core_types>`, :ref:`containers <doc_core_types>`, file I/"
"O, :ref:`Variant <doc_variant_class>`, and :ref:`other utilities "
"<doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros>`."
msgstr ""
"엔진의 핵심에는 :ref:`class_Object` 및 :ref:`class_ClassDB`, :ref:`메모리 관"
"리 <doc_core_types>`, :ref:`containers <doc_core_types>`, 파일 I/"
"O, :ref:`Variant <doc_variant_class>` 등과 같이 엔진 전반에 걸쳐 사용되는 필"
"수 기능과 데이터 구조가 포함되어 있습니다. :ref:`기타 유틸리티 "
"<doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros>`."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/core/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/core>`__"
msgstr "https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "메인"

msgid ""
"The Main component is responsible for initializing and managing the engine "
"lifecycle, including startup, shutdown, and the main loop. "
"See :ref:`class_MainLoop` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Main 구성 요소는 시작, 종료 및 메인 루프를 포함한 엔진 수명 주기의 초기화 및 "
"관리를 담당합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`class_MainLoop`를 참조하세요."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/main/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/main>`__"
msgstr "https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects"
